                                                "sense_id": "75d37299-48a1-3ab6-8c23-6297cc9b820e",
                                                "text": "“I thought she'd just gone to pee but I reckon she must be making hockey too.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b24bec03-e33f-4475-8727-83006cb46aa7",
                                                "sense_id": "75d37299-48a1-3ab6-8c23-6297cc9b820e",
                                                "text": "My anger surged back a pace. “Harry Boone is a lickspittle, butt kissing, hunk of horse hockey,” I said precisely."
